Package: NicheTypeR
Title: Context-Aware Annotation Auditing for Spatial Transcriptomics
Version: 0.0.7
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhequan", "Hu", role = "aut",
           email = "s2024003064@student.pumc.edu.cn"),
    person("Xingang", "Bi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "bixingang@csco.org.cn")
  )
Author: Zhequan Hu [aut], Xingang Bi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Xingang Bi <bixingang@csco.org.cn>
Description: Provides an interpretable evidence-fusion framework for auditing
    cell type annotations in spatial transcriptomics. Candidate labels from
    marker genes or reference mapping can be checked against pathway activity,
    spatial niche compatibility, ligand-receptor consistency, and negative
    marker conflicts, with blocked validation and spatial null controls.
